{"3794400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Swing of the Valkyries", "steam_appid": 3794400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing, dash, and dodge through bullet storms and monster swarms in this relentlessly difficult 3D bullet hell platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective is simple - survive till you reach the end of the level - but getting there alive? That's another story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features optional roguelike mechanics - you can choose to keep challenging the same level repeatedly to achieve mastery, or regenerate the level to face different challenges and terrain. If you manage to win (good luck), you can unlock even higher levels of difficulty (up to 6 at this time), as well as create best time records per difficulty level to challenge later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic 3D Platforming with Swinging, Dashing, Running, and Dodging!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural Level Generation &amp; Enemy Generation with Thousands of Projectiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Unlockable Difficulties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record Tracking for high scores</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing, dash, and dodge through bullet storms and monster swarms in this relentlessly difficult 3D bullet hell platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective is simple - survive till you reach the end of the level - but getting there alive? That's another story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features optional roguelike mechanics - you can choose to keep challenging the same level repeatedly to achieve mastery, or regenerate the l